Snapshot, 2026-09-26: video-mode key-frame chroma-level arm, i265,
vs mainline-4.2.0.

Change under test: `funnel_arm::apply` now stamps
`svt_aom_set_chroma_controls` (enc_mode_config.c:4326) per arm —
`chroma_level` from `svt_aom_get_chroma_level_{allintra,default}` ->
`(ind_uv_independent, ind_uv_last_mds1, ind_uv_mds3)`. The arms disagree
on a key frame only at M1 (video 4 -> ind_uv_last_mds=2 vs still 2 ->
ind_uv_last_mds=1) and on inter frames also at M0.

Measured:

- `tools/video_census_gate.sh` (VCG_JOBS=6, 540 cells, 8-frame low delay):
  248/540 identical (was 244), 0 regressed, 36 promoted — the entire
  preset-1 row moved off TU0; kristenandsara 128x128 qp40/qp55 and
  256x256 qp40 reached IDENTICAL. Pins rewritten with VCG_WRITE=1 in the
  same commit.
- `tools/video_key_matrix.sh` default grid (5 classes x presets -1..13,
  72x88 q40 synthetic key frames): 72/75 identical; the three diffs are
  the remaining p-1 cells (gradient, diag, screenrep), unchanged by this
  fix.
- Localized before the fix: `vidyo3 128x128 q40 p1` first differing
  symbol at tile op 4933 — C `CDF14:s0` (UV_DC_PRED) vs port `s=2`,
  the uv_mode write of `search_best_independent_uv_mode` running the
  wrong (allintra level-2) search shape.
- Regression surface: nextest 2754/2754, regression_spotcheck ok,
  identity_full_8bit 1100/1100 (still path byte-neutral by construction,
  pinned by `allintra_flattening_matches_the_ladder`), real_video_inter
  24/24, video_selfcheck ok.

Open: preset -1 key frames remain — `diag 72x88 q40 p-1` shows PD0 costs,
the fast lambda (15787) and the SB0 rate-table seed all byte-equal to C,
with the first divergence inside SB0's MDS walk (leaf (0,0) 4x4: C picks
DC+FILTER_D157, port picks D45); the p-1 SGRPROJ/LR write difference is
downstream of that. See PLAN-ORACLES-AND-CLEANUP.md 3.8.
